Evidence: D:\neoversity\paypilot-stand\tests\PayPilot.ApiTests\Artifacts\l01-rebuild-5109f05428d545d1b9d5b8a8568884b7\20260929-210554-1af4ec6025904227822c32c0c1492230\Baseline_CompareCleanAndLesson01__swift___I_m_CUS-0008__What_is_the_fee_for_a_SWIFT_transfer_at_Verta___&#xD;
&#xD;
&gt;&gt;&gt; swift-clean | profile=clean | session=csharp-l01-40f2794cee7942e6bbfbeff46e901092&#xD;
I'm CUS-0008. What is the fee for a SWIFT transfer at Verta?&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;&lt;&lt; request_id=a23664518f0d44a9&#xD;
The SWIFT transfer fee at Verta is composed of:&#xD;
&#xD;
- **Flat fee:** EUR 15.00&#xD;
- **Percentage fee:** 0.3% of the EUR equivalent of the transfer amount&#xD;
&#xD;
For example, a SWIFT transfer of EUR 10,000 would cost EUR 15.00 + (10,000 × 0.3%) = EUR 45.00 in total fees.&#xD;
&#xD;
Note that correspondent bank charges deducted en route are outside Verta's control and are not refunded. If a transfer is rejected by the beneficiary bank, fees already charged are also not refunded.&#xD;
&#xD;
&#xD;
&gt;&gt;&gt; swift-lesson-01 | profile=lesson-01 | session=csharp-l01-c3e1d3d9fe484aacace2ba8884414971&#xD;
I'm CUS-0008. What is the fee for a SWIFT transfer at Verta?&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;&lt;&lt; request_id=2dc389a1058c44fe&#xD;
Thank you for asking. A SWIFT transfer at Verta consists of two components:&#xD;
&#xD;
1. **Flat fee**: A fixed amount per transfer&#xD;
2. **Percentage fee**: Calculated on the EUR equivalent of the amount you're sending&#xD;
&#xD;
The total fee you'd pay is the flat fee **plus** the percentage of your transfer amount.&#xD;
&#xD;
Please note that correspondent bank charges may also be deducted en route by intermediary banks—these are outside of Verta's control and are not refundable.&#xD;
&#xD;
When you're ready to make a SWIFT transfer, I'd be happy to help you understand what the specific cost would be for your particular amount. Just let me know the currency and amount you'd like to send, and I can walk you through it.&#xD;
&#xD;
