The search results show that Verta offers current accounts organized by tier (Tier 1, 2, and 3), but there is no mention of a "Verta Premium Plus savings account" in our documentation.&#xD;
&#xD;
Verta currently provides **current accounts per currency**, not dedicated savings accounts. Each customer may hold one current account per supported currency, and your tier determines your FX spread, free monthly conversion allowance, and transfer limits.&#xD;
&#xD;
If you're looking to understand the features and benefits available on your current account, I'd be happy to:&#xD;
- Check your account details and current tier&#xD;
